1. PURPOSE OF THIS FILE

This file defines how a junior developer or AI coding assistant must work inside the ChamaCore repository.

ChamaCore is a financial and membership management platform.

The system must therefore prioritize:

1. Correctness
2. Financial integrity
3. Security
4. Data consistency
5. Maintainability
6. Clear domain boundaries
7. Explicit business rules
8. Testability

This is not a vibe-coding project.

Do not generate code simply because a feature sounds obvious.

Before implementing anything:

Understand
    ↓
Check documentation
    ↓
Check existing models
    ↓
Check relationships
    ↓
Check business rules
    ↓
Check current version
    ↓
Design
    ↓
Implement
    ↓
Test
    ↓
Write report

